SUMMARY:Maker   STEAM Take and Make: Laser Cut Spiral Art kit
DESCRIPTION:Explore curves\, patterns\, and radial symmetry with spiral art 
 in this month's Maker   STEAM Take and Make! Use a laser-cut spiral art set 
 to create your own spiral art for yourself or someone else. This kit 
 includes spiral art wooden pieces\, a few gel pens\, some paper to get you 
 started\, and ideas and resources!\n\nKits are located in the shelving unit 
 outside of the Innovation Lab on the Third Floor at Main Library for you to 
 take home and complete.\n\nFirst come\, first serve while supplies last.
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Caroline Flory":MAILTO:cflory@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Maker, STEAM
