SUMMARY:Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles Screening & Pizza Party!!
DESCRIPTION:"Forgiveness is divine\, but never pay full price for late 
 pizza" - Michelangelo (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles\, 1990) \n\nBeat the 
 summer heat and come cool down in the sewers for some pizza and a great 
 family movie. Join us at 2:00 for a screening of Teenage Mutant Ninja 
 Turtles: Mutant Mayhem\, the most recent animated entry in the terrific 
 Turtles franchise. We will watch this fun movie\, enjoy some fresh pizza 
 from the beloved local Pie Pushers and take part in some pizza-themed arts 
 & crafts. \n\nRated PG for action sequences and mild language. \n\nThe 
 provided pizza will consist of cheese and pepperoni toppings.\n\n \n\n
