DESCRIPTION:Join us for a maker program\, Gadgets and Gizmos\, that will be 
 held every other month (alternating with Create with Me)! \n\nCome out to 
 learn more about fossils that can be found here in NC! In partnership with 
 the NC Fossil Club\, we will spend time learning about and unearthing real 
 fossils that you get to take home!\n\nAll supplies will be provided. 
 Registration is required.\n\nIntended age: Kindergarten - 5th Grade\n\n
