SUMMARY:Baby-sitters Club Book Club @ Southwest
DESCRIPTION:Join Southwest's Baby-sitters Club Book Club! Each month\, 
 we'll discuss a book from the graphic novel series and do a fun activity. 
 Open to ages 7-12. \n\nSome copies will be available at the Children's Desk 
 on a first come first served basis. Interested in a digital copy? Check one 
 out from our Digital Library. \n\nFor more information please email 
 kstockdale@dconc.gov or call (919) 560-8592. \n\n\nMay: Dawn on the Coast 
 \n\nNote: Based on the vote results from April's book club meeting\, we 
 will begin reading the Baby-sitters Little Sister series\, part of the BSC 
 universe\, in June! \n\nJune: Baby-sitters Little Sister: Karen's Witch 
 \n\nJuly: Baby-sitters Little Sister: Karen's Roller Skates\n\nAugust: 
 Baby-sitters Little Sister: Karen's Worst Day
LOCATION:Southwest Regional - Children's Programming Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
