SUMMARY:Crystals and Gems: Wire Wrap Jewelry
DESCRIPTION:Dive into the sparkling world of gems and crystals! We will 
 learn about the differences between gems and crystals\, from how they 
 form\, what makes them special\, and the meanings people have attached to 
 them. After that you'll choose a stone or crystal  and learn simple wire 
 wrapping to turn it into a wearable piece. No experience needed and all 
 materials will be  provided.
