SUMMARY:Page Turners Club
DESCRIPTION:Page Turners Club is a fun and engaging summer reading program 
 for rising 2nd and 3rd graders. Join us every Tuesday and Thursday this 
 summer as we explore exciting stories\, build reading confidence\, and 
 discover the joy of books through read-alouds\, activities\, games\, and 
 prizes. Whether your child already loves reading or is just beginning their 
 reading journey\, Page Turners Club is a welcoming space to grow 
 imagination\, friendship\, and a lifelong love of reading.\n\nSnacks will 
 be provided!\n\nRegistration is required! \n
