SUMMARY:[CANCELLED] Dino Duels - Let's Make Dinosaur Trading Cards!
DESCRIPTION:EDIT: This event is RESCHEDULED. Here is the new event 
 page.\n\n(If link does not work\, copy and paste this into browser: 
 https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17228817)\n\nDesign your own 
 dinosaur trading cards and collaborate with other to create a trading card 
 game (TCG) -- Dino Duels!\n\nThis program will be split into two parts: one 
 hour to design our cards and one hour to create a trading card game and 
 play. This is largely a tween-driven program.\n\nThey choose their 
 dinosaurs\, they create the cards\, and they decide how to gamify it! Be 
 ready to flex your creativity and collaboration muscles!\n\nThere will be a 
 break at the halfway point. Light refreshments are available.\n\nMaterials 
 will be provided. Register to secure your spot!\n\n
LOCATION:South Regional - Children's Programming Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaris T.":MAILTO:amaristorres@dconc.gov
