SUMMARY:Craft Night: D.I.Y. Book Nook
DESCRIPTION:You remember making a shoe box diorama? We'll it's grown up 
 into the Book Nook! This small decorative piece can be used to decorate 
 your shelves at home with a view into another world. Get as creative as you 
 want! Want a fairy garden? A cozy living room? A magical alley? Only your 
 imagination can stop you.\n\nAll materials will be provided. We will be 
 using upcycled materials\, paints\, and other craft supplies. This program 
 is for teens and adults.
