SUMMARY:Drawing for Fun: a Class for Absolute Beginners
DESCRIPTION:Did you love to draw when you were younger and want to 
 recapture the joy of putting pencil to paper? Join us for a fun class on 
 drawing for beginners. This class is aimed at helping you sit down and draw 
