 and letting the ideas flow. If you have supplies you like working with\, 
 feel free to bring them but paper and pencils will be provided. \n\nThis 
 program is open to all but is geared for adults who want to enjoy the 
 process of making art again. \n\nRegistration is not required but will help 
 us plan. \n\nWe will meet in the large meeting room at the North Regional 
 Library\, 221 Milton Rd\, Durham NC 27712. Please email dpeterson@dconc.gov 
