SUMMARY:Durham Cultural Roadmap - Drop In Session
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a drop in session about the Durham Cultural 
 Roadmap—a collaborative plan led by the City of Durham and Durham County 
 to shape the future of arts and culture across Durham. \n\nCity and County 
 staff will be available to answer questions\, share information about the 
 planning process\, and explain how community feedback has guided the plan 
 to date to support artists\, families\, cultural organizations\, and 
 neighborhoods across Durham.\n\nResidents are invited to stop by\, learn 
 more\, ask questions\, and share ideas about Durham’s creative 
 future.\n\nFor more information visit the website: 
 https://www.durhamnc.gov/451/Durham-Cultural-Roadmap \n\n
