SUMMARY:Puzzle Swap!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Bull City Puzzle Swap at Main Library! All ages 
 welcome.\n\nExchange your adult and children's gently used jigsaw puzzles 
 for new-to-you puzzles. Please be sure to check for missing puzzle pieces 
 before you bring them in. All remaining puzzles will be given to Bull City 
 Puzzle Swap for future events.\n\nThis is a drop-in event\, so come anytime 
 during the 2 hours!\n\nFor future puzzle swaps\, be sure to check out Bull 
 City Puzzle Swap's Facebook page.\n\nQuestions? Contact Wynne (she/her): 
 wynnedavis@dconc.gov.
LOCATION:MakerLab\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Wynne Davis":MAILTO:wynnedavis@dconc.gov
