SUMMARY:Character\, Tense\, & Voice (Writing Workshop)
DESCRIPTION:Nothing is more important to the success of your story than 
 readers connecting to your characters. Author Phillip M. Locey will discuss 
 strategies for enhancing that connection\, as well as the importance of 
 choosing the right point-of-view and tense for the story you’re trying to 
 tell.\n\n \n\n
LOCATION:East Meeting Room\, East Regional Library (211 Lick Creek Lane)
ORGANIZER;CN="Phillip Locey":MAILTO:plocey@dconc.gov
