 text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr th\, tr td {\n    
 border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: 
 #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n Learn simple stitches and take home a soft dino friend. 
 This program will be held at 2p.m. on Monday\, July 27\, 2026\, via Zoom. 
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\na {\n    text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr 
 th\, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    
 background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n\n\nThe program includes safe\, 
 kid‑appropriate needles and thread. Some motor skill readiness is 
 recommended.\n\n Virtual Homeschool Learning Lab meets weekly year-round. 
 In the summer\, we ask for registration in order to help with program prep. 
 Please register each child attending. \n\nIf you have any questions\, 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact Molly at 
 mschaefer@dconc.gov.  We ask that all requests be made at least three (3) 
 business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the best 
 accommodations possible!\n\n \n\n
