SUMMARY:Romance Lovers Book Club- Like Real People Do and The Muse of Maiden Lane
DESCRIPTION:All things romance!\n\nThis book club talks about all things 
 romance\, starting with the month's theme but quickly branching out into 
 other books we've been reading and loving\, books we want to read\, and 
 what's going on in Romancelandia - you'll walk away every month with lots 
 of recs for your TBR! Because of our wide-ranging discussions\, you should 
 always feel free to drop in even if you haven't gotten a chance to try the 
 book club picks. This month we're reading\, Like Real People Do by E.L. 
 Massey and The Muse of Maiden Lane by Mimi Matthews. If you want to attend 
 this virtual event\, please register or contact Chelsea Romero at 
 cromero@dconc.gov with any questions. \n\nThis program will be held 
 virtually on July 29\, 2026\, at 6:00 p.m. Once you register for the 
 event\, you will receive a Zoom link!
